{"id":"7101d8e1cbc25a43","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md","title":"Dirichlet Character","display":"df-dirichlet-character — Dirichlet Character","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-dirichlet-character","aliases":["58-df-dirichlet-character","Dirichlet Character"],"display":"df-dirichlet-character — Dirichlet Character","depends_on":["[[58-df-arithmetic]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-dirichlet-character"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-dirichlet-character</span><span>Dirichlet Character</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dirichlet-character — Dirichlet Character"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c112e121aec5c9ff\" href=\"?note=c112e121aec5c9ff\" title=\"58-df-arithmetic\">58-df-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(q\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> (modulus)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb C\">\\(\\chi:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb C\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S\\)</span> (Dirichlet-character predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}character} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\chi,\\mathbb Z,\\mathbb C)\\land\\chi(1)=1\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\chi(mn)=\\chi(m)\\chi(n))\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\chi(n+q)=\\chi(n))\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\chi(n)=0\\leftrightarrow\\gcd(n,q)&gt;1)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}character} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\chi,\\mathbb Z,\\mathbb C)\\land\\chi(1)=1\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\chi(mn)=\\chi(m)\\chi(n))\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\chi(n+q)=\\chi(n))\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\chi(n)=0\\leftrightarrow\\gcd(n,q)&gt;1)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A Dirichlet character modulo <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> is a nonzero completely multiplicative periodic function, extended by zero exactly on integers not coprime to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Its total function type is asserted through the canonical set-function predicate.</li>\n<li>The conductor is the least modulus from which the character is induced; it should not be identified with an arbitrary displayed modulus.</li>\n<li>The Dirichlet <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-series, its convergence, and analytic continuation require separate definition and theorem atoms.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Davenport, Multiplicative Number Theory</li>\n<li>Montgomery and Vaughan, Multiplicative Number Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"c112e121aec5c9ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"q\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi:\\mathbb Z\\to\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}character} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\chi,\\mathbb Z,\\mathbb C)\\land\\chi(1)=1\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\chi(mn)=\\chi(m)\\chi(n))\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\chi(n+q)=\\chi(n))\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\chi(n)=0\\leftrightarrow\\gcd(n,q)>1)","display":true},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1563,"backlinks":[{"id":"dc4eca05b0a09a0b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md]])"},{"id":"6b2a5e68b8567a3e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md]])"},{"id":"7abdef002bccc371","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S$ (Dirichlet 特征谓词, see [[../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md]])"},{"id":"9fa1a80aa97659ab","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (canonical Dirichlet-character predicate, see [[58-df-dirichlet-character]])"},{"id":"53fcdabad44b89e5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$q\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}$ and $\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)$ (Dirichlet character, see [[58-df-dirichlet-character]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-dirichlet-character]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-437","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-dirichlet-character.md|58-df-dirichlet-character]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["c112e121aec5c9ff","36d7463d215be751"]}